    "steps": [
      "Cook the pasta in salted boiling water until al dente. Save half a cup of pasta water, then drain.",
      "While the pasta cooks, warm the olive oil in a large skillet and cook the garlic and red pepper flakes for 1 minute.",
      "Stir in the tomato paste for 1 minute, then add the crushed tomatoes and simmer for 5 minutes.",
      "Lower the heat and stir in the cream and spinach until the spinach wilts.",
      "Add the pasta, Parmesan and a splash of pasta water. Toss until the sauce coats every piece.",
